"Read-only research: all cited pages were fetched and read; Ranker.com blocks automated fetches (401), so it was not used or cited. Aggregation rule applied literally (missing = list length + 5, ties by number of sources, then current-list order). Positions where avg_rank equals the 'no data' value are carryovers from the current list, not measured. One housekeeping note: I briefly wrote a scratch python file to /tmp/agg.py for the averaging and deleted it; nothing else was written."